{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0053_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e59c93a60a21a0f3b4d321d8a95efae42d800bffd2490fb9d4f71c1e8aeed9c7", "ja": "（BIRTH公演の評判がいいおかげで、取材の申し\n込みが相次いでいる。今日は歩の単独インタビューだ）", "zh": "（随着『BIRTH』的公演大获好评，\n采访邀约也接连不断。今天轮到步的单独访谈。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0053_1001_034ayu", "source_sha256": "333976a10158bcc754e0bdaaa2a53aff47c5c2befc48a88c1d27bbdd4d0147dc", "ja": "うう、キンチョーするな～……。\nね、ねえ、{$P$}！", "zh": "呜呜，好紧张喔……\n{$P$}，我、我问你喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0053_1002_034ayu", "source_sha256": "e26a1f3817980405c4591b64e5de5a9416026499b0219069b9a7b54e750e4b3a", "ja": "アタシ、ダンスで気持ちを表現したらダメかな？\nその方が伝わると思うんだけど！", "zh": "我不能用跳舞来表达我的心情吗？\n这样应该会比较好理解吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0053_1003_p", "source_sha256": "b4234b57b7c502ff0d8374301a962b56c289b0c91aa8bea24d9ca18d928d86e0", "ja": "いや、紙面インタビューだからな……。\nダンスはちょっと、伝わらないと思うぞ。", "zh": "不行，这可是文字访谈喔……\n我想，用舞蹈传达恐怕有困难。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0053_1004_034ayu", "source_sha256": "e899937b92b77aabb90dc86282160c3e540f371cacc698d47d06829939cb86d9", "ja": "マイガーッ！　そうだった……。\nうう、トークはニガテなんだよな～。", "zh": "My God！我都忘了……\n呜呜，我不擅长谈话啦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0053_1005_p", "source_sha256": "1e688e2a2f45c1ed9e126cfa46adb212906e7015f6a6675593db0e7aa37c478a", "ja": "普通に話せばいいじゃないか。\n今回の公演で、特に印象深かったこととか。", "zh": "你就照平常表达就好啦。\n像是聊聊你在这次公演中，印象特别深刻的事之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0053_1006_034ayu", "source_sha256": "cb8ee1dd2d1e93c5c2a431c9abde4e7a1079cffe5c7684b9fb4662078cc9a705", "ja": "それが、ありすぎるから困ってるんだよー！", "zh": "就是因为印象深刻的事太多了，我才烦恼啊──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0053_1007_034ayu", "source_sha256": "a73c428f3d76db564ab251c240a35e3c98a44864488d188c1f2d868834d60b27", "ja": "真とダンスできるだけでもサイコーなのに、あずさも\n可奈もついてきてくれて……ホント、うれしくてさ！", "zh": "光是能跟真一起跳舞就已经超棒了，\n梓和可奈还努力跟上我们的脚步……我真的超高兴的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0053_1008_034ayu", "source_sha256": "99cf36dd0010e6bc04a16869978f288c191b83bd639d026b7b1f32b5e27b044d", "ja": "それに、一番最初に振り付けを教わったとき！\nアタシと真に、雪歩がダンスを見せてくれただろ？", "zh": "而且一开始学舞步的时候！\n雪步不是还跳给我跟真看吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0053_1009_p", "source_sha256": "167a7b0ad8aae9936f5a529e26e1dc9dfe51513aea9ac8dd142cfb7491d66802", "ja": "ああ、歩たちのために、雪歩が振り付けを覚えて、\nあとで歩たちに教えてくれたんだったな。", "zh": "嗯，我记得雪步为了你们，\n她还自己先把舞步学会，然后再来教你们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0053_1010_034ayu", "source_sha256": "925dfd3a21fd0617972d48f78be66027bbf53dc238ed97792dce9b94a05b8340", "ja": "あの時は……雪歩の一生懸命な気持ちが、\nたくさん伝わってきたよ。", "zh": "那时候……雪步那份拚尽全力的心意，\n我真的感受超深刻耶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0053_1011_034ayu", "source_sha256": "b4675e0ef18426033ead63c42794062f9c27e896b55cd2245dac7addcc79649d", "ja": "それで、アタシのハートもどんどん熱くなって……。\nうまく言葉にできないけど、とにかくサイコーだった！", "zh": "然后，我的心也跟着越来越沸腾……\n我不太会形容，总之就是棒透了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0053_1012_034ayu", "source_sha256": "2fefa269338dfd5ad073a0e0d08831e97cd1298386ea911ad930676689875c0b", "ja": "こう、ダンスで気持ちがつながった気がしてさ……\nやっぱりいいよな～、ダンスって！", "zh": "该怎么说呢，有种藉着舞蹈心意相通的感觉……\n跳舞果然很棒～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0053_1013_034ayu", "source_sha256": "68bfbb34512f1ebc2e280233276cf5bb95d0e00141ea433d099e68ef09a3b4bd", "ja": "アタシ、ホントにダンスやっててよかったよ。\nBIRTHに出会えたのも、ダンスのおかげかも！", "zh": "我真的好庆幸自己有学跳舞。\n之所以能遇见『BIRTH』，或许也是多亏了跳舞！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0053_1014_p", "source_sha256": "4601f4f114321d124ae8b42f83ba1b1be5b69a333223b468f16980ec24124fd4", "ja": "なるほど……よし。\n歩、今の感じでインタビュー、いけそうか？", "zh": "原来如此……很好。\n步，你可以照刚才那种感觉去接受访谈吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0053_1015_034ayu", "source_sha256": "e7d773f9ad0851cecdf1c1b1131613db078c0b24327294c704684651961dd837", "ja": "え？　あ、う、うん……。\nあ、もしかして、こういうこと？", "zh": "咦？呃，这、这个嘛……\n啊，难不成就是像这样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0053_1016_p", "source_sha256": "d162bd8c809f32de0a99c142b577055587cfaed9e6b088c7e3a75c0672ba43e6", "ja": "もしかしなくても、そういうこと。\nバッチリだったぞ！", "zh": "不用怀疑，就是这样。\n非常完美喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0053_1017_034ayu", "source_sha256": "6da4a61c5c7f5873a8e88b081c08d899f73cea676187915952c11f4831d28974", "ja": "そっか！　よーし、今みたいなのでいいなら、\nアタシ、トークも行ける気がする！　サンキュー！", "zh": "是吗！好～如果照刚才那样就好的话，\n要我谈话应该也不成问题！谢啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0053_1018_034ayu", "source_sha256": "2d62bf0b1de22362d6a2d3542de133aaf442f63ccd6d27359783811b42625410", "ja": "で、本番も{$P$}がインタビュアー\nなら、もっと安心なんだけど……あ、やっぱダメ？", "zh": "要是正式上场也是{$P$}负责访谈，\n我就更安心了说……啊，果然不行吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
